e,"fontSize":"16px","theme":"night","textScale":"100","effects":"on","reducedTransparency":"false","viewportWidth":700,"viewportHeight":420,"scrollTop":521,"scrollHeight":2054,"text":"Settings\nUnsaved changes. Save to apply. · Shortcut choices loaded. Conflicting bindings are preserved; choose a free chord or keep the existing shortcut.\n\n\nClose settings\n\nDismiss help\nExpanded\nKeyboard navigation\nTab and Shift+Tab move focus. Arrows move through lists; Home/End reach endpoints. Enter chooses; Escape closes.\n\nKeeping your preferences\nSave applies appearance preferences. Motion has its own Save. Dismissing help keeps unsaved edits.\n\nWhen an action is not confirmed\nPending is waiting; Refused did not proceed; Unknown is unconfirmed. Refresh reads state without repeating an action.\n\n\nDisable soft effects\nOff\n\nReduce transparency\nOff\n\nFull motion · Follow system\nMotion preference loaded.\n\nFollow system\nSelected\n\nReduced motion\n\nFull motion\n\nSave motion preference\nApply and keep across restart\n\nRefresh motion preference\nRead stored preference; no write is repeated\n\nNight theme\n\nDawn theme\n\nHigh contrast theme\nSelected\n\nText size 100%\nSelected\n\nText size 125%\n\nText size 150%\n\nText size 200%\n\nSave settings\nApply and keep across restart\n\nRefresh settings\nRead stored values; discard unsaved changes\nShortcut choices loaded. Conflicting bindings are preserved; choose a free chord or keep the existing shortcut.\n\nApps menu: SUPER + ALT + SPACE\n\n\nKeep existing shortcut for Apps menu\n\nUse Apps menu default\nSUPER + ALT + SPACE · Available\n\n\nUse Apps menu alternative\nSUPER + CTRL + ALT + SPACE · Available\n\nSystem menu: SUPER + ESCAPE\n\n\nKeep existing shortcut for System menu\n\nUse System menu default\nSUPER + ESCAPE · Available\n\n\nUse System menu alternative\nSUPER + CTRL + ESCAPE · Available\n\nNotification history: SUPER + SHIFT + ALT + comma\n\n\nKeep existing shortcut for Notification history\n\nUse Notification history default\nSUPER + SHIFT + ALT + comma · Available\n\n\nUse Notification history alternative\nSUPER + CTRL + ALT + comma · Available\n\n\nSave shortcut choices\nApply only the free chosen chords; preserve existing bindings\n\nRefresh shortcut choices\nRead stored choices and live bindings without repeating an action\n"}}
